  PDFium            BSD-3-Clause ("Copyright 2014 The PDFium Authors")
  pdfium-binaries   MIT ("Copyright 2014-2025 Benoit Blanchon")
  Abseil            Apache-2.0
  Anti-Grain Geometry 2.3   giấy phép riêng kiểu cho phép (Copyright 2002-2005 Maxim Shemanarev)
  fast_float        MIT
  FreeType          FreeType License (FTL)
